ide the event window; (b) update_event_with_blocks returns block ids. Recommend one card for both; migration must check existing rows first.", "source_file": "docs/plans/PROJECT_STATE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_project_state_waiting_email_stub_branch", "label": "Waiting: Email stub-vs-real branch", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "origin/claude/distracted-haibt-18a25a (04fdc9c, fb49ac1, unmerged). Five calls in handoff_20261031-email-switch-landing.md section 0.", "source_file": "docs/plans/PROJECT_STATE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_project_state_waiting_frontend_items", "label": "Waiting: Frontend items", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Need before/after shown: phone nav clips Settings at 375px (do first); AuthBackdropCard hex gradient and em-dash copy; UX-04 wording; bulk controls for read-only roles.", "source_file": "docs/plans/PROJECT_STATE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_project_state_waiting_claude_md_wording", "label": "Waiting: CLAUDE.md wording", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Hard Rule 1 says OTP/password+MFA while code sends emailed magic link only. Hard Rule 7 (stubbed regardless of stage) turns false once the email branch merges.", "source_file": "docs/plans/PROJECT_STATE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_project_state_waiting_leave_unless_needed", "label": "Waiting: Leave unless needed", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Staff of another org cannot edit event details through the API (pinned in tests/rls/role_rights_q51.rls.test.ts).", "source_file": "docs/plans/PROJECT_STATE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "a